WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Atoms and bonding. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Connect structure to basic properties

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Atomic arrangement and bonding help explain material properties, but a simple particle sketch is not a complete material model.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Compare a schematic ordered lattice with a polymer chain; connect each to a property question, not an unsupported ranking.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Model matching

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Material category alone does not guarantee strength, durability or safety.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Connect structure to basic properties
